  "project_description": "Provides extra functionality not found in core related to content blocks and plugin blocks. In the 2.0.x release the single feature is a form enhancement on the block placement form ('/admin/structure/block/manage/{block}'): for a placed content block it adds a 'Block Extras' fieldset containing an 'Edit this block content' link (with a destination back to the current path) and a live rendered preview of that block's content.",
